+  workspace-hash: e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855
+  output (4 lines):
+    | range:[1, 2, 3]:1:3:null:true
+    | iteration:[1, 2, 3]:[3, 2, 1]
+    | fresh:[9, 2, 1]:[8, 20, 30]:[1, 2, 3]
+    | writes:[plain-rhs, plain-caught, compound-rhs, compound-caught, postfix-caught, alias-caught, sort-caught, negative-oob-caught]:[1, 2, 3]:[1, 2, 3]
+
+## Fogell
